Bxg7, Kh7, Bf6!, Qxf6, Rxf6, Rxf6, Rg3 and white is up a clean c pawn. 

Bxg7, Rxg7, Rxg7+, Kf8, Rg8+, Kf7, R2g7+, Ke6, Ng6, white should stand a bit better with the exposed king and knight ready to jump to e4 too, black can't threaten mate quickly because h5 and g4 covered. 

