So by process of elimination Bxg7 is most likely the correct move. But let's look at that queen sac line a bit more;

Bxg7, Bxg2, Bf6+, Kh2, Bxh4, Kxg3, Kxg2, Rd7 (threatening to infiltrate.), Kf2, Rd1, Ke2, Rc1, wait no the bishop is on h4, so roo kcan ujust swing over to a1 after Ke2

